    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i know people say that but... i don't really believe it anymore. like who would actually notice. my parents would obviously but they're back in india. here? nobody. i could just disappear one day and my team would just redistribute my tasks and move on\n\nhonestly the worst part is i trained him. i showed him everything. and they still picked him. i think they just see me as... temporary. like i'm passing through. doesn't matter what i do\n\ni don't know why i even stay tbh",
